1
00:00:06,530 --> 00:00:09,090
That was the 10th time I've peed here.
我已經上了十次廁所

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:12,370
It's also the 10th time you've told us.
你也跟我們說了十次

3
00:00:12,610 --> 00:00:14,670
Sorry,it must be hard to hear.
抱歉，你們一定聽得很煩

4
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:19,880
It's easier having babies playing "Bring in Da Funk" on your bladder!
三個寶寶在你的膀胱上 蹦蹦跳跳比較好玩

5
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,250
I am so sick of being pregnant. God!
我真是受夠懷孕了

6
00:00:25,420 --> 00:00:29,250
I can't sleep,except on my back, which hurt. So I can't sleep.
我睡不著，除非睡床上 但是又會痛，等於睡不著

7
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:33,160
My only happiness is from a cup of coffee...
我唯一的樂趣來自咖啡 

8
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:36,020
...which is decaf because I'm pregnant!
但它是低咖啡因的因為我懷孕

9
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,330
You want a cookie?
菲比，你要吃餅乾嗎？

10
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,810
Thank you so much!
太謝謝你了

11
00:00:46,210 --> 00:00:50,040
So,honey,how are those mood swings coming?
你的情緒起伏還好嗎？

12
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:52,770
I haven't had any yet.
我還沒有這個困擾

13
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,080
The One with the Worst Best Man Ever
本集播出：「史上最差伴郎」

00:00:57,950 --> 00:00:59,080
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

14
00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:43,990
Hey,guys.

15
00:01:44,170 --> 00:01:47,260
All right,here's the ring.
這就是戒指

17
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:50,460
Yes,yes! A thousand times,yes!
我願意，我願意，千百個願意

18
00:01:52,010 --> 00:01:54,370
Any ideas for the bachelor party?
單身派對有想法了嗎？

19
00:01:55,910 --> 00:02:00,470
Before rings and bachelor parties,you have to decide who your best man will be.
托管戒指辦派對前 應該先選個伴郎吧？

20
00:02:00,650 --> 00:02:02,280
Oh,it's awkward.
真尷尬，尷尬尷尬

21
00:02:04,950 --> 00:02:06,650
I already asked Chandler.
我已經找錢德了

22
00:02:07,620 --> 00:02:10,180
He got to do it at your first wedding.
什麼？你上次結婚他就當過了

23
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:13,560
I figured you'd understand. I've known him longer.
我以為你會瞭解 我們認識比較久

24
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:17,750
I don't have any brothers. I'll never be a best man.
拜託啦，我沒有兄弟 我永遠都沒機會了

25
00:02:18,030 --> 00:02:20,730
You can be the best man when I get married.
你可以當我的伴郎

26
00:02:20,970 --> 00:02:23,730
I'll never get to be a best man!
我沒機會了啦

27
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,270
Wait,wait.
等一下

28
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:30,430
So you'll be my best man twice, and I won't be yours at all?
我讓你當兩次 你一次也不讓我當？

29
00:02:31,610 --> 00:02:35,070
Of course,you can be my best man.
你當然可以當我的伴郎

30
00:02:39,250 --> 00:02:42,820
-What about me? You said I could. -I'm not getting married!
那我呢？你說我可以當 我又沒有要結婚

32
00:02:43,090 --> 00:02:46,150
It's a question for science-fiction writers.
那是科幻小說要挑戰的題材

33
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:48,160
I can't believe it's not me.
你居然不找我 

34
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:50,930
-How could it not be me? -I'm not even
你怎麼可以不找我？ 我又沒要… 我又沒要…

35
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:53,330
You know what? That's it.
好了，夠了

37
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,300
From now on, Joey will be my best man.
喬伊，從現在起你當我的伴郎

38
00:02:58,070 --> 00:03:00,600
Shame about you,though.
帥！不過你真的很爛

39
00:03:05,010 --> 00:03:06,810
-Stop it. -What?
別鬧 怎麼了？

40
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:09,010
One of the babies is kicking.
有個寶寶在踢 

41
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,610
That's a good thing.
那不是好事嗎？

42
00:03:10,820 --> 00:03:14,250
It's not kicking me. It's kicking another baby.
不是踢我，是踢另一個寶寶

43
00:03:15,420 --> 00:03:18,360
Don't make me come in there!
別逼我進去

44
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:22,650
Do you have a big bowl I can borrow?
有碗公可以借我嗎？

45
00:03:22,930 --> 00:03:25,660
There's one under the cabinet.
檯子下面有一個

46
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:29,700
-Why do you need it? -We're having a party tomorrow night.
幹嘛？ 我們明天要開派對，回見

47
00:03:29,940 --> 00:03:33,900
-Are you planning on inviting us? -No. Later!
你們有打算要找我們嗎？ 沒有，回見

49
00:03:34,780 --> 00:03:37,180
Get your ass back here,Tribbiani!
崔比亞尼，給我滾回來

50
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:42,140
Hormones.
荷爾蒙

51
00:03:43,380 --> 00:03:46,840
How come you're having a party and we're not invited?
菲比的意思是 你們開派對怎麼不找我們？

52
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:50,180
-It's Ross' bachelor party. -So?
那是羅斯的單身派對 所以呢？

53
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:51,450
Are you bachelors?
你們是單身漢嗎？ 不是

54
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,460
Are you strippers?
你們是脫衣舞孃嗎？ 不是

55
00:03:57,930 --> 00:03:59,630
Then you're not invited.
那就抱歉了

56
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:03,170
Then you're not invited to our party either.
那你們也別想參加我們的派對

57
00:04:03,370 --> 00:04:04,930
What party?
什麼派對？

58
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,570
Phoebe's baby shower.
菲比的送禮會

59
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:16,040
Baby shower? That so doesn't sound like something I want to do.
送禮會？ 聽起來就很不想參加，回見

60
00:04:18,090 --> 00:04:21,320
I can't believe I'm going to have a party.
你們居然要幫我辦派對

61
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:24,010
That's so great. A party!
太棒了，派對耶

62
00:04:32,530 --> 00:04:34,230
I don't know why.
我也不懂

63
00:04:35,270 --> 00:04:38,570
This is what I got going for the party liquor-wise.
在酒方面我的計劃是

64
00:04:38,810 --> 00:04:41,300
-Get a lot of liquor. -Great.
買一大堆酒 很好

65
00:04:41,580 --> 00:04:45,480
In terms of the invite list, I got you,me and Chandler.
至於邀請名單有你、我、錢德

66
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:49,050
I'll invite Gunther because we're talking pretty loud.
我會請阿甘 因為我們討論得很大聲

67
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:50,940
I'll be there.
我會去

68
00:04:51,790 --> 00:04:53,750
I know it's your party...
派對是為你辦的 

69
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:57,320
...but I'd like to limit the number of museum geeks.
但我想限制博物館怪腳的人數

70
00:04:57,560 --> 00:05:02,590
Let's not invite any anthropologists. Just the dinosaur dudes.
那就別找人類學家 找搞恐龍的就好

71
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:08,660
We'll need a six-pack of Zima.
好，還得買半打汽水酒

72
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:11,940
Hey,what are you doing?
你們在幹嘛？

73
00:05:12,140 --> 00:05:16,240
Just planning my bachelor party with my best man.
跟我的伴郎籌劃我的單身派對

74
00:05:16,410 --> 00:05:18,740
Good luck trying to top the last one.
祝你們辦得比上次好

75
00:05:19,010 --> 00:05:22,780
It won't be that difficult since this one won't be...
不難，因為這次 

76
00:05:22,980 --> 00:05:25,080
...in the basement of a Pizza Hut.
不會辦在必勝客的地下室

77
00:05:26,150 --> 00:05:29,920
I'm Ross,I'm Ross. I'm too good for the Hut.
我是羅斯，必勝客配不上我

78
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:34,990
I gotta go pick up Ben. Everything sounds great.
我得去接兒子，看樣子沒問題

79
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:38,390
Keep it on the mellow side. A few guys hanging out.
總之不要太瘋，大家聚聚打牌

80
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:41,530
-No strippers or anything. -You got it.
不要找脫衣舞孃，好嗎？ 沒問題

81
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:43,300
See you later.
待會見

82
00:05:45,170 --> 00:05:47,770
Have fun planning your mellow party.
好好辦不能瘋的派對吧

83
00:05:48,940 --> 00:05:54,110
There will be strippers. He didn't say anything about no strippers.
會有脫衣舞孃，他沒說不要

84
00:05:55,380 --> 00:05:56,980
He just said,"No strippers."
他剛就說不要

85
00:05:57,290 --> 00:05:58,780
I chose not to hear that.
我當做沒聽到

86
00:06:01,190 --> 00:06:03,380
Look what I got,look what I got!
你看我買了什麼

87
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,730
They make these for little people!
居然有這種童裝

88
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:12,990
Little Village People.
給鄉下小孩穿的

89
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:20,300
Look at this one. This is my favorite.
你看這件，我最喜歡這件

90
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:23,000
That is so sweet.
太可愛了 

91
00:06:23,310 --> 00:06:25,300
Phoebe will love dressing them.
菲比一定會很喜歡打扮他們

92
00:06:27,620 --> 00:06:31,810
Except she won't be the one who gets to dress them.
但到時替他們打扮的不是她

93
00:06:33,590 --> 00:06:35,950
She won't get to keep the babies.
因為她不能把寶寶留著

94
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:40,350
My God,we are throwing the most depressing baby shower!
天哪 這真是最令人沮喪的送禮會

95
00:06:42,260 --> 00:06:46,460
Unless we give her all gifts she can use after her pregnancy.
除非送她產後可以用的禮物

96
00:06:46,700 --> 00:06:49,000
Like regular coffee. Tequila!
像普通咖啡，龍舌蘭 一整盒煙

97
00:06:49,170 --> 00:06:51,830
-A carton of cigarettes! -She doesn't smoke.
一整盒煙？ 她又不抽煙 

98
00:06:52,010 --> 00:06:55,370
-It's the thought that counts. -It's a great idea.
心意最重要 好主意 

99
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:58,600
And those leather pants she's always wanted!
還有她一直想要的皮褲

100
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:00,270
She'll love that!
她一定會很高興

101
00:07:00,550 --> 00:07:02,070
What the hell is this?
這是什麼玩意？

102
00:07:03,790 --> 00:07:05,980
You thought it'd make me feel better?
送我2個月後才能用的禮物 

103
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:09,710
To give me something I can't use for two months?
我的心情會好嗎？

104
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,410
This sucks!
爛透了

105
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:16,650
-Who gave me this? -Well,l
這是誰送的？ 我…我…

106
00:07:16,830 --> 00:07:19,030
They told me you like them.
她們說你喜歡

107
00:07:20,570 --> 00:07:25,870
All right,then I'm wrong. It's a great gift. The best present I ever got!
好吧，我錯了 這是我收過最棒的禮物

108
00:07:26,270 --> 00:07:27,870
What's my next present?
下一個禮物呢？ 

109
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:30,240
We don't have anything.
我們都沒帶

110
00:07:31,310 --> 00:07:34,370
All right,fine,then this is over.
好吧，送禮會結束

112
00:07:36,550 --> 00:07:38,280
Balloons!
真是的…放什麼汽球

113
00:07:41,060 --> 00:07:43,790
-Listen,about the stripper.... -Yeah?
對了，那個脫衣舞孃…

114
00:07:43,960 --> 00:07:45,980
Good call!
叫得好

115
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:50,160
So I'll be hosting your next bachelor party?
知道下次要找誰辦了吧

116
00:07:50,330 --> 00:07:53,790
Joey,I'm kind of hoping this will be my last one.
我希望這是最後一次

117
00:07:54,670 --> 00:07:56,830
A little announcement.
請注意

118
00:07:57,510 --> 00:08:01,670
I've decided that my best man is my best friend Gunther.
我決定我的伴郎 是我最要好的朋友阿甘

119
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:06,100
What's my last name?
我姓什麼？

120
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,010
Central Perk?
中央咖啡館？

121
00:08:11,150 --> 00:08:13,480
Thanks for not marrying Rachel.
謝謝你沒娶瑞秋

122
00:08:13,750 --> 00:08:16,590
Hey,Gunther! Don't forget your shirt.
阿甘，記得拿衣服

123
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:18,920
What are those?
那是什麼？ 

124
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,820
Little party favors. Check it out.
派對小贈品，你看

125
00:08:21,867 --> 00:08:22,829
（98羅斯蓋勒單身派對）

126
00:08:25,771 --> 00:08:27,898
（伴郎喬伊崔比亞尼）

127
00:08:29,540 --> 00:08:34,300
Just want everybody to know the position of my best man is still open.
請注意，我的伴郎人選還空著

129
00:08:36,010 --> 00:08:38,670
So is the position of the bride.
新娘人選也是

130
00:08:39,380 --> 00:08:40,440
Great.
很好

131
00:08:41,150 --> 00:08:42,140
Smooth,man.
有一套

132
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,810
You got some chili on your neck.
你的脖子沾到辣椒

133
00:08:47,990 --> 00:08:51,720
I just want to say thanks,everyone. This was great!
謝謝大家，今晚很愉快

134
00:08:51,990 --> 00:08:54,290
See you guys Monday morning.
星期一早上見

135
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:00,230
-Thanks,Joey. -Don't forget your shirt.
喬伊，謝了 別忘了拿衣服

136
00:09:04,070 --> 00:09:06,900
Hey,museum geeks! Party's over.
博物館怪胎，派對結束了

137
00:09:07,170 --> 00:09:10,410
Wave bye-bye to the nice lady. There you go.
跟小姐說再見，快點

138
00:09:10,680 --> 00:09:14,050
Back to your parents' basement. All right.
回爸媽的地下室去

139
00:09:16,750 --> 00:09:19,620
Boys,come on out. Here you go.
出來吧，來

140
00:09:21,220 --> 00:09:23,880
Look at the birdies! Are those yours?
好可愛喔，是你養的？

141
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:28,320
They let you keep chickens and ducks as pets?
我不知道可以養雞鴨當寵物

142
00:09:28,530 --> 00:09:31,190
And I got the duck totally trained too.
我把鴨子訓練得很好，你看

143
00:09:31,700 --> 00:09:33,760
Stare at the wall.
盯著牆壁

144
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,660
Hardly move.
幾乎不動

145
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,670
Be white.
白白的

146
00:09:40,910 --> 00:09:43,240
You are good at that.
你真行

147
00:09:44,210 --> 00:09:45,540
I had fun tonight.
今晚很愉快

148
00:09:45,710 --> 00:09:49,770
-You throw one hell of a party. -Thanks. It was great meeting you.
派對辦得很棒 謝了，很高興認識你

150
00:09:50,020 --> 00:09:54,850
If any of my friends ever get married or have a birthday or a Tuesday....
要是我有朋友要結婚 或是過生日、過星期日…

151
00:09:55,060 --> 00:09:57,290
Yeah,that'd be great.
那就太好了

152
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:00,920
So,I guess,good night.
那就再見了

153
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:04,630
Unless you want to hang around.
除非你想留下來 是嗎？

155
00:10:07,370 --> 00:10:09,800
I'll let you play with my duck.
對，你可以跟我的鴨子玩

156
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,980
Stripper!
跳脫衣舞的

157
00:10:38,170 --> 00:10:40,830
The stripper stole the ring!
舞孃把戒指偷走了

158
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:44,730
Chandler,get up! The stripper stole the ring!
錢德，起床 舞孃把戒指偷走了

159
00:10:44,970 --> 00:10:47,530
-What? -The ring is gone!
什麼？ 戒指被偷了

160
00:10:48,580 --> 00:10:51,840
Just give me a minute to wake up for this.
先讓我清醒一下

161
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:57,510
You lost the ring. You're the worst best man!
你把戒指弄丟了 你是最爛的伴郎

162
00:10:58,650 --> 00:11:02,950
This isn't funny. I go to sleep,everything's cool.
不好笑，怎麼辦？ 我去睡覺，一切正常

163
00:11:03,160 --> 00:11:06,180
I wake up,the stripper's gone, and the ring is gone!
等我醒來，舞孃不見了 戒指也不見了

164
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:08,330
-You slept with her? -Of course!
你跟她上床？ 廢話

165
00:11:11,270 --> 00:11:14,200
-Hi,guys. -Hi,Phoebe.
你們兩個 菲比

166
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:21,170
I wanted to apologize if I seemed a tad edgy yesterday at my shower.
我想說聲抱歉 我昨天在送禮會上似乎凶了點

167
00:11:23,110 --> 00:11:24,170
Just the hormones.
荷爾蒙作祟

168
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,740
-No,we -Hormones.
別這樣，我們…  荷爾蒙嘛

169
00:11:26,980 --> 00:11:30,010
I wanted to say thank you. It was so sweet.
謝謝你們，你們真有心

170
00:11:36,320 --> 00:11:38,620
You seem to be doing much better.
你似乎好多了，太好了

171
00:11:38,830 --> 00:11:41,020
-How are things going? -Good.
你現在怎樣？ 很好

172
00:11:41,260 --> 00:11:46,260
Everything's been about me lately. So what's happening with you?
最近的注意力都在我 你們呢？

173
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:51,030
We were just talking about me not going to Ross' wedding.
我們正在說 我不去參加羅斯的婚禮

174
00:11:51,670 --> 00:11:56,040
It just might be too hard, given the history and all that.
有那段過往 我可能很難面對

175
00:11:56,280 --> 00:12:00,210
This reminds me of the time when I lived on the street.
這讓我想起當年流落街頭時

176
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:03,680
This guy offered to buy me food if I slept with him.
有人說我陪他上床就請我吃飯

177
00:12:06,550 --> 00:12:08,610
How is this like that?
這兩件事哪裡像？

178
00:12:08,860 --> 00:12:12,790
Well,let's see. It's not really like that.
我想想…的確不像

179
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:15,500
Because that was an actual problem.
因為那才算是問題

180
00:12:15,730 --> 00:12:19,220
And yours is just a bunch of high-school crap...
你這只是高中女生無病呻吟 

181
00:12:19,470 --> 00:12:22,130
...that nobody really gives!
沒人在乎

182
00:12:27,410 --> 00:12:29,400
I'm sorry. I just thought
抱歉，我只是…

183
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,150
Here come the water works.
淚眼攻勢來了

184
00:12:34,350 --> 00:12:37,940
I called the company that sent her, and they don't care.
我已經沒轍了 我打給仲介站，他們不管

185
00:12:38,220 --> 00:12:42,350
I called 911 and they yelled at me. This is an emergency!
我打119又被吼 這還不算緊急事件嗎？

186
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:45,950
I really wanna help you out, but I got plans to go see Titanic...
我真的很想幫忙 但我打算去看「鐵達尼號」

187
00:12:46,130 --> 00:12:50,060
...so I've got to call 911 to find out what time it starts.
所以我要打119問場次

188
00:12:51,330 --> 00:12:52,920
Hey,guys.
我來了

189
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:57,600
Thanks again for last night. What a great party.
謝謝你，派對辦得很棒 

190
00:12:57,770 --> 00:12:59,540
The guys from work had a blast.
博物館那夥人玩得很爽

191
00:12:59,810 --> 00:13:03,770
One of them had never been to a bachelor party before.
其中有一個沒參加過單身派對

192
00:13:03,980 --> 00:13:07,070
Another one had never been to a party before.
另一個沒參加過派對

193
00:13:08,880 --> 00:13:11,250
So that wedding ring.
那個結婚戒指

194
00:13:12,890 --> 00:13:15,650
-Man,that is nice. -Yeah,right?
可真漂亮 漂亮吧

195
00:13:15,820 --> 00:13:18,620
I might pick one of those babies up for myself.
我也想買一個

196
00:13:18,790 --> 00:13:21,560
Where might one get one of those?
要去哪裡買？

197
00:13:22,130 --> 00:13:25,720
When my grandmother first came to this country...
那個戒指？ 我奶奶剛來到這個國家時

199
00:13:25,970 --> 00:13:30,800
...that ring and the clothes on her back were all she had with her.
全身上下只有那只戒指 和一小包衣服

200
00:13:32,970 --> 00:13:37,140
So you might say that the ring is irreplaceable.
所以那只戒指可說是無可取代

201
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:41,140
Absolutely. It's been in my family for generations.
當然，它是我家的傳家寶

202
00:13:41,420 --> 00:13:45,150
Every bride who's worn it has lived a long and happy life.
每個戴上它的新娘 都能幸福到老

203
00:13:45,390 --> 00:13:48,450
So you might say it's a magic ring.
所以簡直算是一隻魔戒

204
00:13:52,690 --> 00:13:55,560
Yeah,the stripper stole it.
被脫衣舞孃偷了

205
00:13:57,500 --> 00:13:58,990
What?
什麼？

206
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:02,760
-What did you just -I think I heard what he said.
你剛才說… 我想我聽到了

207
00:14:02,940 --> 00:14:08,100
I believe it was, "The stripper stole the ring."
應該是說… 「被脫衣舞孃偷了」

209
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:12,040
My ring? My wedding ring?
偷了我的戒指？我的結婚戒指？ 

210
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:16,310
The stripper stole my wedding ring?
脫衣舞孃偷了我的結婚戒指？

211
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:18,580
How could this happen?
怎麼會這樣？

212
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:22,880
It all started when you said, "Joey,you be my best man!"
原因就在於你說了 「喬伊，你來當我的伴郎吧」

213
00:14:25,330 --> 00:14:27,990
All right. I'm going to call the cops.
好，我來報警

214
00:14:28,260 --> 00:14:31,560
I screwed up. But you don't have to turn me in.
我搞砸了你也不用報官捉我

215
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:35,740
-Not on you,on the stripper. -I already did that.
不是捉你，是捉那個舞孃 我試過了 

216
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:40,000
They said they'd look into it after they solve all the murders.
他們說等偵破所有謀殺案再說

217
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:43,770
-We'll call the company that sent her. -I did that too.
那就找仲介站 我也試過了 

218
00:14:44,010 --> 00:14:45,740
They wouldn't give me her real name.
他們不肯透露她的真名或電話

219
00:14:45,910 --> 00:14:48,110
They said if I bother them again, they'd call the police.
他們說我再打去就要報警

220
00:14:48,280 --> 00:14:52,410
I said,"You talk to the police, you tell them I'm missing a ring."
我說「你去啊」 「就說我掉了一隻戒指」

221
00:14:52,650 --> 00:14:54,450
So,what are you telling me?

222
00:14:54,620 --> 00:14:56,210
There's nothing we can do?
難道一點辦法也沒有？

223
00:14:56,390 --> 00:15:01,260
-How could this happen? -Look,Ross,I am so sorry.
怎麼會這樣？ 羅斯，我真的很抱歉

225
00:15:05,100 --> 00:15:07,590
What if we just called her...
我們可以再叫她一次 

226
00:15:07,800 --> 00:15:10,790
...used a fake name and had her come to my office?
用假名把她找去我的辦公室

227
00:15:11,070 --> 00:15:14,510
That sounds like fun, but we got a ring to find!
好像不賴，但我們得找戒指

228
00:15:21,180 --> 00:15:23,270
Here's your tea,Phoebe.
菲比，你的茶

229
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,310
It's so good.
感覺真好

230
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,660
Thanks.
謝謝

231
00:15:33,860 --> 00:15:36,760
-Good. -So glad you like it.
那就好 你喜歡就好

232
00:15:37,870 --> 00:15:40,560
What? She made the tea.
怎樣？茶是她泡的

233
00:15:41,800 --> 00:15:44,770
I think I just had a contraction.
不是，我剛才陣痛了

234
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:45,930
-What? -My God!
什麼？ 天哪

235
00:15:46,170 --> 00:15:48,330
I felt one a few minutes ago.
幾分鐘前就有一次 

236
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:50,470
That definitely was one.
這次絕對錯不了

237
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:52,340
You can't have the baby here.
你不能在這裡生 

238
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:55,140
I haven't sterilized the apartment since the guys moved out!
男生搬走之後我還沒消毒

239
00:15:55,320 --> 00:16:01,310
It's okay. I'll boil some water and rip up some sheets.
沒事，別怕，我來燒水撕床單

240
00:16:02,820 --> 00:16:04,550
It's probably false labor.
別緊張，可能是假性陣痛

241
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:08,090
That can happen near the end. Just get the book.
接近預產期會這樣，去拿書來

242
00:16:08,260 --> 00:16:10,130
-Get the book! -The book!
瑞秋，拿書來 書，好

243
00:16:13,070 --> 00:16:15,700
-The Bible? -I don't know!
聖經？ 我哪知啊

244
00:16:21,110 --> 00:16:22,940
All right. This is great.
好，很好

245
00:16:23,210 --> 00:16:24,870
You get behind the desk.
錢德，你站到桌子後面

246
00:16:25,080 --> 00:16:28,380
When she comes in, she won't recognize you because
但願她一進來不會認得你 因為…

247
00:16:28,580 --> 00:16:30,410
Well,why would she?
她怎麼會認得你

248
00:16:31,250 --> 00:16:33,280
And then you buzz Ross and l.
然後你對羅斯和我打暗號

249
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:37,510
You be Mr. Gonzales, and I'll be Mr. Wong.
你是岡薩勒斯先生 我是王先生

250
00:16:38,930 --> 00:16:40,360
Diverse.
民族大鎔爐

251
00:16:42,060 --> 00:16:44,830
Anybody call for security?
有人叫警衛嗎？

252
00:16:45,830 --> 00:16:48,030
You be cool.
冷靜

253
00:16:54,540 --> 00:16:56,840
Which one is Gunther Central Perk?
好，哪位是阿甘中央咖啡館？

254
00:16:58,680 --> 00:16:59,770
Joey.
喬伊

255
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:03,310
Where's my ring? My dead grandmother's wedding ring.
我的戒指呢？ 我過世的奶奶的結婚戒指呢？

256
00:17:05,550 --> 00:17:07,710
Way to be cool,man.
你還真冷靜

257
00:17:08,490 --> 00:17:09,510
What?
你在說什麼？

258
00:17:10,320 --> 00:17:14,560
There was a ring in a box. After you left,it was gone.
床頭櫃的絲絨盒裡有只戒指 你一走它就不見了

259
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,790
You think I stole some ring?
你們覺得我偷了戒指？

260
00:17:19,630 --> 00:17:22,730
We know you took it! Just save yourself the time and confess.
一定是你偷的 少廢話，從實招來

261
00:17:22,940 --> 00:17:25,840
Who are you,the Hardy Boys?
你們是少年偵探團嗎？

262
00:17:28,810 --> 00:17:33,180
I don't need to steal a stupid ring. I make $1,600 a week.
我不必偷什麼戒指 我1星期賺1600

263
00:17:33,410 --> 00:17:35,410
Any of you guys make that?
你們有人賺那麼多嗎？

264
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:38,180
Marry me.
嫁給我

265
00:17:41,460 --> 00:17:45,290
I don't get it. It was in my room all night. She didn't take it.
我不懂，戒指整晚都在我房裡

266
00:17:45,530 --> 00:17:48,590
I didn't take it. You didn't take it. Then who did?
她沒拿，我沒拿，你沒拿 那是誰拿的？

267
00:17:51,170 --> 00:17:53,190
We're trying to think.
安靜，我們在想事情

268
00:18:06,780 --> 00:18:09,720
I don't get how you know it's false labor.
你怎麼會知道是假痛？

269
00:18:09,950 --> 00:18:11,440
Do you see any babies?
你有看到寶寶嗎？

270
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:16,850
-How do you feel? -Okay,I guess.
你感覺如何？ 還好吧

271
00:18:17,620 --> 00:18:19,290
I don't know.
我不知道 

272
00:18:19,530 --> 00:18:22,720
I know it's going to be over soon so....
大概是知道快要結束了

273
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:25,520
But isn't that a good thing?
那不是很好嗎？

274
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:29,390
-You said you were sick of this. -I know.
你說你受夠了 我知道

275
00:18:29,670 --> 00:18:32,400
Usually,when you're done with the pregnant thing...
只是通常懷孕完之後 

276
00:18:32,670 --> 00:18:34,900
...you get to do the mom thing.
就是當媽媽

277
00:18:36,380 --> 00:18:41,750
But I'll be sitting around in my leather pants,drinking tequila.
我卻會穿著皮褲喝龍舌蘭

278
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:46,080
Some moms do that.
有些媽媽也會那樣

279
00:18:47,090 --> 00:18:48,350
That's even sadder.
那樣更悲慘

280
00:18:49,860 --> 00:18:53,690
Look,I know what I got myself into.
我知道這麼做的後果

281
00:18:54,360 --> 00:18:58,320
It's just that now that they're in me...
但他們現在在我肚子裡

283
00:18:59,100 --> 00:19:02,500
...it's like I know them and....
我彷彿瞭解他們

284
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:07,200
It just won't be easy when these babies have to go away.
把他們送走時我會很難受

285
00:19:08,010 --> 00:19:09,940
I know,sweetie.
我知道

286
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:12,680
But it's not like you won't have anything.
但你並不會一無所有

287
00:19:12,880 --> 00:19:16,250
You'll have nieces and nephews. That's even better.
你會有姪子姪女 那樣甚至更棒

288
00:19:16,620 --> 00:19:19,250
-Yeah,okay. -No,really.
少來 不，是真的

289
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:24,250
You won't be the one worrying about saving for college.
你不必擔心他們的大學學費

290
00:19:24,530 --> 00:19:26,860
Or yelling at them when they're bad.
或在他們不乖時罵他們

291
00:19:27,090 --> 00:19:30,960
Or putting them on Ritalin when they just won't calm down.
或在他們吵個不停時 餵他們吃立得寧

292
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:38,040
You'll be the one they run away to. The one they talk to about sex.
他們逃家會來找你 會找你討論性的問題

293
00:19:38,310 --> 00:19:40,430
You just get to be cool Aunt Phoebe.
你可以當酷阿姨菲比

294
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,740
Cool Aunt Phoebe.
酷阿姨菲比

295
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:46,600
I am pretty cool.
我是蠻酷的

296
00:19:48,550 --> 00:19:52,950
And you know what else? Are they going to love you!
還有，他們一定會愛死你

297
00:19:53,950 --> 00:19:55,980
They are going to love me.
他們會愛死我

298
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:59,620
Thanks,you guys. Again.
謝謝你們…再次感謝

299
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:02,050
Oh,sweetie.
謝什麼

300
00:20:04,330 --> 00:20:05,320
Thanks.
謝謝 

301
00:20:05,500 --> 00:20:06,490
What?
怎麼了？

302
00:20:06,670 --> 00:20:07,690
Just kidding.
開玩笑的

303
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:10,490
Oh,my God!
怎麼了？ 天哪

304
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:12,530
Got you again. You're so easy!
又騙到了，你們真好騙

305
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:18,340
If anything happens to him
要是它有事… 

306
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:21,510
The vet said it's a simple procedure.
喬伊，獸醫說手術很簡單

307
00:20:21,720 --> 00:20:24,780
Things can go wrong. What if he doesn't make it?
所以呢？搞不好會出錯 要是它沒撐過來呢？

308
00:20:25,050 --> 00:20:28,220
-He will,Joe. -But what if he doesn't?
它會的 要是沒有呢？

309
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:31,290
He's such a good duck.
它這麼乖巧

310
00:21:09,930 --> 00:21:11,660
I'm so worried about him!
我好擔心它

311
00:21:12,870 --> 00:21:14,860
Somebody lose a ring?
有人掉了戒指嗎？

312
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:18,600
Oh,my God! Thank you! Thank you so much!
天哪！謝謝你，謝謝

313
00:21:22,180 --> 00:21:23,670
How's the duck?
鴨子怎麼樣？

314
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:25,850
Just fine. You'll see him in a bit.
它很好，正在休息 你們可以去見它

315
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:27,840
Great.
太好了

316
00:21:28,050 --> 00:21:31,280
-Thanks for being so cool. -No,that's all right.
羅斯，謝謝你這麼好脾氣 沒關係 當然有關係

317
00:21:31,550 --> 00:21:36,110
You made me your best man and I totally let you down.
你找我當伴郎，我卻讓你失望

9
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:38,450
-It's not your fault. -Yeah,it is.
又不是你的錯 當然是

320
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:40,450
You wouldn't have lost it.
你就不會弄丟戒指

321
00:21:40,730 --> 00:21:45,100
Ross,you were right. He should be your best man.
你知道嗎？羅斯，你是對的 他才應該當你的伴郎

322
00:21:45,300 --> 00:21:47,200
-No,you should. -Don't argue.
不，應該你當 別吵了

323
00:21:48,570 --> 00:21:50,300
I get to choose my best man.
伴郎是我選的

324
00:21:52,070 --> 00:21:53,900
I want both you guys.
你們兩個我都要

325
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:57,270
Really?
真的？

326
00:21:58,050 --> 00:22:00,980
Both you guys should be up there with me.
你們都應該陪我站在神父面前

327
00:22:01,280 --> 00:22:02,650
You two are my
你們是我的…

328
00:22:04,750 --> 00:22:07,620
I'm lucky to have just one good
有一個好朋友就…

329
00:22:09,490 --> 00:22:11,320
Thanks,man.
謝了

330
00:22:13,130 --> 00:22:15,990
I got to go check something,okay?
我去那邊看看

331
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:23,130
-What a baby! -Total wuss.
真孩子氣 有夠愛哭的

332
00:22:31,680 --> 00:22:35,340
-How come you're getting Nana's ring? -Mom gave it to me.
為什麼奶奶的戒指是給你？ 是媽給我的

333
00:22:35,520 --> 00:22:38,970
She said something about it being a wedding ring and that you may not need...
她說有個婚戒比較大 你又可能...

335
00:22:39,150 --> 00:22:40,710
...one.
...用不上

336
00:22:41,660 --> 00:22:44,250
I really didn't need to tell you all that.
我實在不必說這些

337
00:22:44,420 --> 00:22:47,550
I don't really think it's fair. I mean,I've always loved that ring.
我覺得不公平 我一直很喜歡那個戒指

338
00:22:47,730 --> 00:22:49,360
Oh,Mon,I'm sorry.
對不起

339
00:22:49,530 --> 00:22:53,430
I'd let you have it, but Emily's gotten really attached to it.
我原本會讓給你 但艾蜜莉對它愛不釋手

340
00:22:53,600 --> 00:22:55,190
Thanks.
好吧 謝謝

341
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:57,630
-Here you go. -Thanks.
拿去 謝謝

342
00:22:57,800 --> 00:23:01,900
Emily,did you know that that ring spent two days in a duck's colon?
你知道那個戒指 在鴨子肚子裡擺了2天嗎？

343
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


344
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


